WEBVTT

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.410
Ouch!

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.410
My head really hurts.

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:28.540
No more alcohol for me.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.200
Whose handkerchief is this?

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:41.540
It's not mine.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.700
What happened last night?

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.080
Huh?

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.580
What... was that?

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.540
RAGE

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.370
Do you remember
how you got back home?

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.330
I woke up in bed.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.450
I don't remember anything.

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:56.620
Not even the Prince taking care of you?

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.290
No...

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.000
Excuse me, Retsuko.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.040
Yes!

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:12.290
Please deliver this to Shimada
in the Sales department.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:14.290
Understood.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:17.330
Do you know Resasuke?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.080
<i>Tell him to make his submissions ASAP.</i>

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.910
<i>If he's not there, leave him a note.</i>

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.620
Hey, Retsuko.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:37.910
Oh, Haida. Good morning.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:43.200
Since when do you drink canned coffee?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.290
Oh, this? I thought I'd give it a try.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:56.500
Excuse me! Miss Tsubone asked me to hurry,
so I'll see you later.

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:58.910
I see...

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.450
SALES DEPARTMENT

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.290
<i>Everyone is away at meetings, of course...</i>

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.040
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:18.290
<i>He's here!</i>

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:21.870
Good morning.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:26.160
Hello.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:29.080
I have a message from Miss Tsubone.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:32.000
Please ensure
you submit the receipts ASAP.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.700
And...

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.120
It seems I was a pain at the weekend.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.830
Thank you for helping me out.

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.790
I must have been a sorry sight.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.250
<i>Whoa. Whoa!</i>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.080
<i>Whoa! Whoa!</i>

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:02.910
Whoa!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:15.290
Short-timer! Get this done.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.500
Thank you. I'll do my best.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.040
Oh... right...

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.120
Short-timer! Tea!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.620
<i>Coming!</i>

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.120
<i>The whole world looks different.</i>

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.120
<i>Changing jobs,</i>
<i>getting married and quitting...</i>

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.750
<i>That was never important!</i>

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.620
<i>All I needed was love!</i>

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.410
KARAOKE

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.250
You've fallen for someone?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:16.040
She has completely fallen for him.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.700
The other day, she told us
there was no one she liked.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.290
She's inexperienced,

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:23.330
but it seems she's the type
that falls in love easily.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.540
-What is he like?
-Do you have a photo?

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:29.700
Sure, but it's kind of embarrassing...

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.950
-Show us!
-Should I?

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.910
-Show us!
-Should I?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.040
-OK, then. It's no big deal.
-Here he is.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.870
He seems cool... I guess.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.450
I know, right? He's cool, isn't he?

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.540
They do say that love is blind.

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.700
-What?
-Don't mind me.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.500
What else do you like about him?

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.910
Tell us!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.160
Oh, should I?

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.000
Fine. It's no big deal.

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.660
When I got drunk, he helped me recover.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.790
Not only is he kind...

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.450
but, somehow,
the air around him feels different.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.370
He's always staring into the distance.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.660
I don't really know why...

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.910
but when we're together, I feel calm.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:32.950
I'm happy for you, Retsuko.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.120
I'm sure he's wonderful.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.250
This is embarrassing.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:42.080
I'm getting teary-eyed
just thinking about it. How strange!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:45.120
I have to go to the bathroom!

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.830
He is not cool...

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:58.750
This guy reminds me of
a soft candy for babies.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:02.290
I know, right? My thoughts exactly!

00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:07.950
SALES DEPARTMENT

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.330
Well, Resasuke,
I never realized you were so smooth!

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.200
I'm what?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.950
Look!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.950
DID YOU FORGET YOUR INVOICE?

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.870
SUBMIT YOUR RECEIPTS SOON - RETSUKO

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:24.450
Isn't Retsuko the girl
who came to the mixer?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.950
Yes, she seems to be very diligent.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.790
Think again, idiot.
What are you talking about?

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:35.910
She's obviously trying to nudge you
into asking her out.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:39.790
You can literally smell it in these notes.

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.160
Ask her out on a date.

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.950
-Who?
-Retsuko!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.950
-Why?
-Why?

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:55.500
Did you really think I invited you
to the mixer just to even out the numbers?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.040
I did it because I'm worried about you!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:03.040
-Why?
-You don't have a girlfriend!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.000
-But...
-Don't "but" me!

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:09.790
Listen, I'll explain
why you need a girlfriend

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:11.580
in a simple and logical manner.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:12.830
Reason one...

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:29.040
<i>Today, we meet again.</i>

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.120
Would you like to go on a date?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:58.790
Yes...

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.040
TEA ROOM

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.910
LET'S GO ON SUNDAY.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.580
WHERE AND WHEN SHOULD WE MEET?

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.540
10 a.m., at our destination...

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.580
Don't meet up at the destination!

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.500
Meet her at the nearest station
and go together!

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:39.410
-Why?
-Don't "why" me!

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.250
LET'S MEET AT THE STATION.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.040
I JUST ARRIVED.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.250
ARE YOU HERE?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.540
RESASUKE?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.750
I'M HERE.

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:15.750
<i>Now, we're a couple.</i>

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:23.200
<i>No matter how you look at it,</i>
<i>we're a couple.</i>

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.910
<i>To everyone enjoying their day off,</i>
<i>excuse my excitement.</i>

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.620
<i>We, as a couple,</i>

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:35.870
<i>are about to visit an amusement park!</i>

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:52.040
<i>Once upon a time</i>

00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:57.000
<i>I was always crying inside my heart</i>

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:01.410
<i>Once upon a time</i>

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.700
<i>I was always daydreaming</i>

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:11.950
<i>You're the Out-of-Pocket Prince</i>

00:11:12.290 --> 00:11:16.500
<i>You're the Metal Princess</i>

00:11:16.950 --> 00:11:23.080
<i>The two of us met at a mixer</i>

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:31.290
<i>A drunken office mixer</i>

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:42.290
<i>We work in different departments</i>

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:48.870
<i>But our hearts beat as one</i>

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:02.660
<i>-Did you escort her?</i>
-Yes, I did.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:06.790
<i>-Did you hold hands at sunset?</i>
-Yes, we did.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.200
<i>Great! Well done.</i>

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:11.830
Men are judged on the first date.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.910
Show her that you're a real man!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:19.500
Ouch!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:26.450
-I'm back.
-Hello again!

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.750
I expect all this walking around
has tired you out.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.910
Shall we find a restaurant
and take a break?

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.450
I'm fine.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:39.200
I'm not tired at all. Let's go.

00:12:40.660 --> 00:12:41.500
Right...

00:13:05.540 --> 00:13:07.160
Aren't you cold?

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:12.870
I'm fine. I'm not cold at all.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.200
KARAOKE

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.540
We had... so much fun!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:29.870
-That's great.
-Was there anything you got upset about?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.750
Couples usually fight
when they go to amusement parks.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:35.120
Not at all.

00:13:35.200 --> 00:13:38.620
He took the lead
and made sure that I was enjoying myself.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:40.870
He is surprisingly dependable.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:43.040
Ouch!

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:47.410
Wait, what happened to your foot?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.870
Maybe he dragged her everywhere.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.160
Is he a schoolboy or something?

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:54.620
Oh, please!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.160
As it turns out, he's not very attentive.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:02.120
-If I were you, I would have gone home.
-No way...

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:06.120
It was my fault
for choosing brand new shoes.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.620
SEND

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.950
Do you want to sing your usual song?
You must have a lot of pent-up anger.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.830
Yes, release it by singing.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.410
I have nothing to complain about.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.080
PAUSE

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.910
I'm really happy right now!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.830
<i>You're the Out-of-Pocket Prince</i>

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:50.870
<i>You're the Metal Princess</i>

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:57.450
<i>The two of us met at a mixer</i>

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:05.160
<i>A drunken office mixer</i>

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.910
Subtitle translation: John Haguewood
